[250],[],{"_166":181,"_168":182,"_183":251,"_185":252},[],"Built on a compact 240sqm allotment","86cd1d0f95a9",[256],[],{"_166":181,"_168":182,"_183":257,"_185":258},[],"Approximately 205sqm (22 Squares) custom residence","ff4b3e2b5912",[263],[],"h3",{"_166":181,"_168":182,"_183":264,"_185":265},[],"Key Features","782d0c018f67",[269],[],{"_166":181,"_168":182,"_183":270,"_185":271},[],"Through intelligent design, efficient project management and close coordination with trades, Siari Build successfully delivered a spacious and functional custom home in just three months. Open-plan living, quality materials and carefully selected finishes create a modern residence that offers exceptional value while exceeding the client’s expectations.","a3c6f6928eef",[275],[],{"_166":181,"_168":182,"_183":276,"_185":277},[],"Our Solution","a0f37d40bcae",[281],[],{"_166":181,"_168":182,"_183":282,"_185":283},[],"Designing a comfortable family home on a compact 240sqm block required careful planning to maximise internal living space while maintaining a practical layout, natural light and street appeal. The objective was to create a home that felt significantly larger than its footprint while delivering premium finishes within an efficient construction timeframe.","18576792e97c",[287],[],{"_166":181,"_168":182,"_183":288,"_185":289},[],"The Challenge","46168750c9d6",[293],[],{"_166":181,"_168":182,"_183":294,"_185":295},[],"Completed in just three months, the project demonstrates Siari Build’s ability to deliver high-quality homes efficiently without compromising craftsmanship or attention to detail.","a1e241a503c7",[299],[],{"_166":181,"_168":182,"_183":300,"_185":301},[],"The Tarneit Cathedral Residence is a contemporary custom home designed to maximise space, natural light and functionality on a compact 240sqm allotment. Despite the site’s size, this 22-square residence delivers a spacious and modern family environment through clever design, quality finishes and efficient use of every square metre.","a3c9646c59f8",[306],[],"h2",{"_166":181,"_168":182,"_183":307,"_185":308},[],"Overview",{"_310":311,"_312":313},"settings",{"_349":350,"_351":352,"_353":354,"_355":356,"_357":100,"_358":359,"_360":-5,"_361":362,"_363":317,"_364":-5,"_365":-5,"_366":-5,"_367":368,"_369":370,"_371":-5,"_372":373,"_374":375,"_376":377,"_378":379,"_380":381},"navigation",{"_314":315,"_316":317,"_318":319,"_320":321},"footerMenu",[342,343,344,345,346],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[327,328,329,330],"socialMenu",[322],{"_323":-5,"_324":325,"_119":326},"icon","label","Instagram","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_324":-5,"_332":340,"_334":341},{"_324":-5,"_332":338,"_334":339},{"_324":-5,"_332":336,"_334":337},{"_324":331,"_332":333,"_334":335},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_324":-5,"_332":340,"_334":341},{"_324":-5,"_332":338,"_334":339},{"_324":-5,"_332":336,"_334":337},{"_324":-5,"_332":333,"_334":335},{"_324":-5,"_332":347,"_334":348},"privacy-policy","Privacy Policy","address","Point Cook, Victoria","copyrightText","All rights reserved.","email","info@siaribuild.com.au","legalLine","ABN 20 688 039 894 | Builder License CDB-U 101713","maintenanceEnabled","maintenanceHeading","WE'RE ON THE TOOLS.","maintenanceImage","maintenanceMessage","The site's getting a quick upgrade and will be back shortly. In the meantime, if you'd like to start a project, reach us using the options below.","maintenanceShowContact","mapAddressLabel","mapLocation","mapZoom","notFoundButtonLabel","Back to Home","notFoundHeading","THIS ONE'S OFF THE PLANS.","notFoundImage","notFoundMessage","The page you're after isn't here — moved, renamed, or never built. Let's get you back to solid ground.","phone","0419 000 991","siteName","Siari Build","tagline","We don't just build houses. We build the next forty years of your life.","workingHours","Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 2