 living and dining","53e71389d3bc",[228],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":229,"_205":230},[],"Premium bathrooms with quality fixtures","a56feefc4804",[234],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":235,"_205":236},[],"Tiled flooring throughout living areas","84375ecf30ce",[240],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":241,"_205":242},[],"Designer kitchen with stone benchtops","2354d8b33592",[246],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":247,"_205":248},[],"Refrigerated heating and cooling","89cc6c9d9f60",[252],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":253,"_205":254},[],"Contemporary architectural façade","a98313c1dea2",[258],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":259,"_205":260},[],"Feature cathedral ceiling","1305b6c70db4",[264],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":265,"_205":266},[],"Completed in just 3 months","e78f3fe8b087",[270],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":271,"_205":272},[],"Built on a compact 240sqm allotment","86cd1d0f95a9",[276],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":277,"_205":278},[],"Approximately 205sqm (22 Squares) custom residence","ff4b3e2b5912",[283],[],"h3",{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":284,"_205":285},[],"Key Features","782d0c018f67",[289],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":290,"_205":291},[],"Through intelligent design, efficient project management and close coordination with trades, Siari Build successfully delivered a spacious and functional custom home in just three months. Open-plan living, quality materials and carefully selected finishes create a modern residence that offers exceptional value while exceeding the client’s expectations.","a3c6f6928eef",[295],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":296,"_205":297},[],"Our Solution","a0f37d40bcae",[301],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":302,"_205":303},[],"Designing a comfortable family home on a compact 240sqm block required careful planning to maximise internal living space while maintaining a practical layout, natural light and street appeal. The objective was to create a home that felt significantly larger than its footprint while delivering premium finishes within an efficient construction timeframe.","18576792e97c",[307],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":308,"_205":309},[],"The Challenge","46168750c9d6",[313],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":314,"_205":315},[],"Completed in just three months, the project demonstrates Siari Build’s ability to deliver high-quality homes efficiently without compromising craftsmanship or attention to detail.","a1e241a503c7",[319],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":320,"_205":321},[],"The Tarneit Cathedral Residence is a contemporary custom home designed to maximise space, natural light and functionality on a compact 240sqm allotment. Despite the site’s size, this 22-square residence delivers a spacious and modern family environment through clever design, quality finishes and efficient use of every square metre.","a3c9646c59f8",[326],[],"h2",{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":327,"_205":328},[],"Overview",{"_330":331,"_332":333},"settings",{"_369":370,"_371":372,"_373":374,"_375":376,"_377":103,"_378":379,"_380":-5,"_381":382,"_383":337,"_384":-5,"_385":-5,"_386":337,"_387":388,"_389":390,"_391":392,"_393":394,"_395":-5,"_396":397,"_398":399,"_121":400,"_401":402,"_403":404},"navigation",{"_334":335,"_336":337,"_338":339,"_340":341},"footerMenu",[362,363,364,365,366],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[347,348,349,350],"socialMenu",[342],{"_343":-5,"_344":345,"_139":346},"icon","label","Instagram","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_344":-5,"_352":360,"_354":361},{"_344":-5,"_352":358,"_354":359},{"_344":-5,"_352":356,"_354":357},{"_344":351,"_352":353,"_354":355},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_344":-5,"_352":360,"_354":361},{"_344":-5,"_352":358,"_354":359},{"_344":-5,"_352":356,"_354":357},{"_344":-5,"_352":353,"_354":355},{"_344":-5,"_352":367,"_354":368},"privacy-policy","Privacy Policy","address","Point Cook, Victoria","copyrightText","All rights reserved.","email","info@siaribuild.com.au","legalLine","ABN 20 688 039 894 | Builder License CDB-U 101713","maintenanceEnabled","maintenanceHeading","WE'RE ON THE TOOLS.","maintenanceImage","maintenanceMessage","The site's getting a quick upgrade and will be back shortly. In the meantime, if you'd like to start a project, reach us using the options below.","maintenanceShowContact","mapAddressLabel","mapAreaRadius","mapHidePin","mapLocation",{"_188":405,"_406":407,"_408":409,"_410":411},"mapZoom",12,"notFoundButtonLabel","Back to Home","notFoundHeading","THIS ONE'S OFF THE PLANS.","notFoundImage","notFoundMessage","The page you're after isn't here — moved, renamed, or never built. Let's get you back to solid ground.","phone","0419 000 991","Siari Build","tagline","We don't just build houses. We build the next forty years of your life.","workingHours","Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 2:00 PM\nSunday: Closed","geopoint","alt",7,"lat",-37.895696,"lng",144.76186]
